    {
      "id": "k98lpf",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -158.97406931858575,
      "y": 299.51425085197263,
      "width": 1157.6622299009143,
      "height": 600.5695408277844,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 70,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 12088120,
      "version": 657,
      "versionNonce": 1132467006,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793462721095,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. The Problem = The Paris municipal government is receiving a huge amount\nof incidents during a small period of time and using different channels,\nsometimes multiple people are reporting the same problem, meaning they are\ngetting not organized and finding it hard to keep track of the problems and\ndon't know which one to prioritize.\n\n2. The Solution = An Internal government operation dashboard,  where only\nthe government authorized officials can see the incidents, identify the urgent\nproblems, assign the work and status, and also track the progress all in one\nplace.\n\n“Our goal is to design a dashboard that brings all the information and\ndetails to one place and helps the officials make organized and quicker\ndecisions.”\n\n ",
      "originalText": "1. The Problem = The Paris municipal government is receiving a huge amount of incidents during a small period of time and using different channels, sometimes multiple people are reporting the same problem, meaning they are getting not organized and finding it hard to keep track of the problems and don't know which one to prioritize.\n\n2. The Solution = An Internal government operation dashboard,  where only the government authorized officials can see the incidents, identify the urgent problems, assign the work and status, and also track the progress all in one place.\n\n“Our goal is to design a dashboard that brings all the information and details to one place and helps the officials make organized and quicker decisions.”\n\n ",
      "fontSize": 30.02847704138922,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": false,
      "index": "b0g5",
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
