    {
      "id": "q8yrIDN8HLuoiO3sFIrUG",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1173.8117042132876,
      "y": 382.8102946754983,
      "width": 1133.7220679928905,
      "height": 506.6276223292376,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 70,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1616437797,
      "version": 608,
      "versionNonce": 395593506,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793462721095,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "“First the Citizen reports the incident through an online form and an existing channel\nwhich can be connected to the dashboard but has an access limit; they can't access the\ngovernment dashboard though.”\n\n3 main government staffs \n1. Officer = the person who is assigned to check the incoming problems/ incidents reports\nand decides  whether it needs more attention.\n\n2. Supervisor =  is the person who is going to oversee the problem and assign the work to\nan available team that will respond to the problem.\n\n3. Member of the team = is the responsible to handle the incident and update the incident\nstatus to “in progress”or “solved”\n\n\n ",
      "originalText": "“First the Citizen reports the incident through an online form and an existing channel which can be connected to the dashboard but has an access limit; they can't access the government dashboard though.”\n\n3 main government staffs \n1. Officer = the person who is assigned to check the incoming problems/ incidents reports and decides  whether it needs more attention.\n\n2. Supervisor =  is the person who is going to oversee the problem and assign the work to an available team that will respond to the problem.\n\n3. Member of the team = is the responsible to handle the incident and update the incident status to “in progress”or “solved”\n\n\n ",
      "fontSize": 25.33138111646188,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": false,
      "index": "c0Ai",
      "created": 1792908101125,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
