      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793462709398,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Risk - False reports may lead to incorrect decisions.\nRisk - Two officers might try to update the same incident simultaneously.\nRisk - Sensitive incident information could be accessed without permission.\nAssumption  -  The government has existing incident-reporting channels.\nAssumption  -   Supervisors are responsible for approving assignments.\n\nTrade-off - We are focusing on essential incident-management features first\ninstead of spending time on advanced AI features.",
      "originalText": "Risk - False reports may lead to incorrect decisions.\nRisk - Two officers might try to update the same incident simultaneously.\nRisk - Sensitive incident information could be accessed without permission.\nAssumption  -  The government has existing incident-reporting channels.\nAssumption  -   Supervisors are responsible for approving assignments.\n\nTrade-off - We are focusing on essential incident-management features first instead of spending time on advanced AI features.",
